  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">Uttar Pradesh UP DELEd 2 Year Course Admissions 2024</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2024-12-26T14:14:01+05:30\">December 26, 2024</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">2:14 pm</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://updeled.gov.in/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"UPDELED\">Examination Regulation Authority UP, PNP Prayagraj\u00a0</a>,</strong> The <strong>Counseling Date</strong> for the <strong>UP DELED (BTC) Online Exam 2024</strong> has been released. The result will be declared on <strong>26th December 2024</strong> and will be available as a <strong>PDF file</strong> on the official <strong>UP DELED website</strong>. It is important to note that <strong>UP DELED Phase-I Counseling</strong> will be conducted from <strong>26th December 2024 to 12th January 2025.</strong></span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><style>\n        .social-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .social-button {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 10px 20px;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: white;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        .whatsapp {\n            ba