; height: 11px;\">09 January 2025</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\">09 Jan 2025 \u2013 14 Jan 2025</td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\">,00,001 \u2013 2,40,000</td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\">15 January 2025</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>How To Fill UPDELED 2024 Choice Filling &amp; Counselling 2024\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Steps to Fill UP DELED 2024 Choice Filling &amp; Counselling:</strong></span></h3>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Visit Website:</strong> Go to <a href=\"https://updeled.gov.in/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_new\">https://updeled.gov.in/</a>.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Login:</strong> Enter your <strong>Registration Number</strong> and <strong>Password</strong>.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Verify Details:</strong> Check your personal information and rank.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Fill Choices:</strong> Select and arrange preferred colleges.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Lock Choices:</strong> Submit and lock your preferences.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Download Slip:</strong> Save the confirmation for reference.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Check Allotment:</strong> View seat allotment status online.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Admission:</strong> Visit the allotted college for document verification and fee submission.</span></li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tb